    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyaakaki aairrash enaitanapishe Sairos",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Darias olaiguanani aitayu enkitanapata, nejurruni te Babilon, te nkaji nashumieki mbaa musan, teine apa neshumieki mbaa naaigeroki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te Ebatana, teina anasa kitok natii olkerenket le Media, netumi teine olpiyayati oigerore ena: “Embae nadamuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le dukuya le nkitoria e Sairos olaiguanani, naitayu Sairos olaiguanani enkitanapata: Naipirta enkaji e Nkai te Yerusalem, ejo, nchoo metesheti ina aji, ine wueji apa neishoorieki ilasarri, neyauni ilasarri oopejori; ore enkadoro enye naa keaku ntemat e nkaina ntomoni ile ore endapasho naa ntemat e nkaina ntomoni ile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neeta nkererin uni oo soito sapuki, o enkereri nabo oo mbaoi; nchoo elaata e nchetata enye meitayuni to lchumati lo laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii nchoo inapa masaa e sahabu o ne nkosholai e nkaji e Nkai naawa Nebukadnesa te nkaji e Nkai natii Yerusalem, neya Babilon, errinyuni aayau atua ina aji e Nkai natii Yerusalem, neyauni ake pooki nabo ewueji enye, nipik ninche atua enkaji e Nkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitanapishe Darias pee elo esiaai dukuya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neirriwaa Darias ena walata; ejo, Ore taata Tetanai, olbalusui lo lkerenket otii teidia alo olkeju, o Shetar-bosenai, o lelo le ncholuek ino, lelo balusuni ootii olkerenket otii teidia alo olkeju, entalamari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "entalam esiaai ena aji e Nkai; enchoo olbalusui loo lyahudi, o lpayiani loo Lyahudi eitoki aashet ena aji e Nkai te wueji enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii aitayio nanu enkitanapata naipirta enintaasiasa kulo payiani loo Lyahudi te nchetata ena aji e Nkai; kelaakini kulo tung'ana te nkiputakinoto to lchumati le nkitoo nemeimutieki te kodi naing'uaa olkerenket otii teidia alo olkeju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entoki pooki nayieuni - ilooti oing'ok, ilmeregeshi, anaa nkerra tenkaraki ilasarri oopejokini Enkai e keper, o enkano, o emunyan, o enaisho oo sabibu, anaa eilata, anaa enayieu ilapolosak te Yerusalem, nchoo ninche ina anaake, nemepali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee etum ninche aaishooi ilasarri ooitishipisho te Nkai e keper, neomonoki enkishui o laiguanani o layiok lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aitayio sii enkitanapata nchere teneibelekeny ake oltung'ani ena limunoto, neiwuang'ieki imbokishi te nkaji enye, nesheyieki ninye, neaku enkaji enye olkiu le modioi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Enkai apa naitamanya enkarna enye ine wueji, metusulai pooki aiguanani o ltung'ana ooitorioo nkaik enye aaibelekeny ena, anaa einyal ena aji e Nkai natii Yerusalem. Nanu Darias oitayio ena kitanapata nchoo metaasi neibung'i aakurraki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitisinyaki enkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te risioroto eilo rorei oirriwayie olaiguanani Sairos, neas Tatenai ilo balusui lo lkerenket otii teidia alo olkeju o Shetar-bosenai, o lelo le ncholuek enye, nena pooki naaitanapishe olaiguanani Darias. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hag 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Saka 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ilpayiani loo Lyahudi neshetisho nebul, teina aibon apa e Hagai oloiboni le Nkai o Sakaria olayioni le Ido. Eidipa ninche ina aji enye te nkitanapata e Nkai oo Siraeli o te nkitanapata e Sairos o Darias o Artaseses olaiguanani le Parsia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neidipe apa ena aji te nkolong e uni o lapa le Adar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Adar",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enkarna naipotieki olapa abo loo Lyahudi",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to lari le ile le nkitoria o laiguanani Darias.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana loo Siraeli, ilapolosak o Lawi, o lelo kulikae apa ootorrinyunye te yararoto, neraposhoki enkitisinyata eina aji e Nkai te nchipai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishooyo ninche teina kitisinyata ena aji e Nkai iloing'ok iip nabo, o lmeregeshi iip are, o lkuo le kerra iip ong'uan, neitayu anaa olasar le ng'oki too Siraeli pooki ilkineji tomon oare, terisioroto e siana oo loshon loo Siraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik ninche ilapolosak ilturrurri lenye nepik Ilawi irishat enye e siaai, tenkaraki enkisiaayiare e Nkai te Yerusalem anaa enaigeroki te mbuku e Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
